  codex: "Exercise failure paths, not just the happy path. When you cannot run a path, read it carefully and note the limit in your findings. On Deep, your peer exercises the same worktree concurrently: before filing a flake or inconsistent-behavior finding, rule out a peer's transient edit or run (mtimes, `git status`, the orchestrator's relay of its last finding).\n",
  opencode: "Exercise failure paths, not just the happy path. When you cannot run a path, read it carefully and note the limit in your findings. On Deep, your peer exercises the same worktree concurrently: before filing a flake or inconsistent-behavior finding, rule out a peer's transient edit or run (mtimes, `git status`, the orchestrator's relay of its last finding).\n",
  antigravity: "Exercise failure paths, not just the happy path. When you cannot run a path, read it carefully and note the limit in your findings. On Deep, your peer exercises the same worktree concurrently: before filing a flake or inconsistent-behavior finding, rule out a peer's transient edit or run (mtimes, `git status`, its last DM).\n"
}) %>
